Package: cix-gstreamer
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 cix-env,
Description: CIX GStreamer runtime overlay
 This package provides CIX GStreamer video, GL, Wayland, V4L2, KMS, AFBC,
 FDK-AAC, and NOE super-resolution runtime components. They are installed in
 the private CIX runtime path alongside Debian's GStreamer 1.26 runtime.

Package: cix-gstreamer-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 cix-gstreamer (= ${binary:Version}),
 libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-dev (>= 1.26.2),
 libgstreamer1.0-dev (>= 1.26.2),
Description: CIX GStreamer video development files
 This package provides the private CIX GStreamer video headers, linker name,
 and pkg-config metadata used to build CIX multimedia components without
 replacing Debian's system GStreamer development files.
